# Trivy exceptions. Each entry says why it does not apply and expires, so it gets re-checked.

# golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is unmaintained (GO-2026-5932, no fixed version). Trivy flags the
# whole x/crypto module, but no Ziro-OS binary imports openpgp: ziroctl uses x/crypto for
# acme/autocert and friends, and cni-dhcp only pulls it in indirectly. Verify with:
#   go list -deps ./... | grep x/crypto/openpgp   (in tools/ziroctl and packages/cni-dhcp: no output)
# Image signatures are verified with cosign's sigstore format, never OpenPGP.
GO-2026-5932 exp:2027-03-31
